Regarding {{full_name}} ({{student_id}}).

The following coursework passed its deadline and has not been received:

  Assignment: {{title}}
  Subject:    {{subject_name}}
  Teacher:    {{teacher}}
  Was due:    {{due_date}}

This is contact stage {{level}} of 3 ({{level_name}}).

What happens next
-----------------
  - If the work has been submitted another way, reply and we will correct the record.
  - If there is a reason it is late — illness, a clash, difficulty with the task — tell {{teacher}}. An extension agreed in advance is straightforward; work that simply never arrives is not.
  - If nothing is received, this will continue to escalate, and a missing piece of coursework can affect a predicted grade.

We would rather sort this out than keep sending these. Please get in touch with {{teacher}}.

{{system_name}}
